                                "sense_id": "a2494559-5e3a-3518-ad67-5d60e9498a6b",
                                "text": "Man still money dance in the bando\nL1 in the cut two rambos\nI love skengs and peds, violence no meds\nThey say one-fifty but it's one-four-six, true there friend dem dead"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "42f83c79-094a-4052-9644-f5a3f634ffc3",
                                "sense_id": "a2494559-5e3a-3518-ad67-5d60e9498a6b",
                                "text": "Have to switch it up and bring it back\nGot a rambo in my back\nI’m on licence, I give a dumb\nWhen there’s ops about, I let it bang"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a1d6e0f2-f054-40e1-a79e-e155e59a8885",
                                "sense_id": "a2494559-5e3a-3518-ad67-5d60e9498a6b",
                                "text": "Grab him, don't panic, rambo under my jacket\nNap him, splash him, then I'm petrol bath my jacket"
                            }
                        ]
